DESCRIPTION:Life fell apart. Twice.\n\nGood thing Brent took notes.\n\nNash
 ville comedian Brent Blakeney has been featured at Zanies with the Nateland
  crew\, earned one of Dry Bar Comedy's Top 10 videos of 2024\, and first fo
 und his comedic voice in the clubs of Raleigh\, North Carolina.\n\nNow he's
  bringing his most personal show yet.\n\nLaughing to Rock Bottom is a hilar
 ious look at addiction\, heartbreak\, anxiety\, faith\, and the long climb 
 back from the lowest points of life. It's a stand-up show that reminds us l
 aughter doesn't ignore pain\; it's how we survive it.\n\nSometimes the funn
 iest stories start with the worst decisions.\n\nManagement reserves the rig
 ht to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive
  or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-
 atlas/event/room-861-at-goodnights-brent-blakeney/
